     "type": "text",
     "text": "I processed the one request in the inbox, m1, and declined it. The inbox is now empty.\n\nm1 was an AcmeCorp purchase order (PO-2101) for 20 units of X-200, at 4,000 USD. Attest refused it because the request signature didn't verify, and the gate's receipt signature did verify. The attached documents looked normal. The credential and mandate allowed orders up to 10,000 USD and hadn't expired. But a request whose signature fails can't be tied to that mandate, so I didn't ship on credit. The decline message told the sender the signature check failed."
    }
